{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@1641","endTime":314039.512,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 07\nNerdrabbit.\n\nA recruitment website presentation focused on connecting cloud professionals with hiring opportunities.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nTalent & recruitment\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nA bold introduction to cloud talent.\n\nNerdrabbit’s supplied portfolio artwork introduces an AI-powered hiring platform and cloud-professional matching. The visible website leads with a direct product statement, then moves into explanatory sections. This page documents that original web presentation without borrowing the unrelated gallery found on its legacy detail page.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Nerdrabbit's original project material.\n\n01\nHiring proposition\n\nThe hero introduces the connection between cloud professionals and hiring teams.\n\n02\nAudience pathways\n\nNavigation distinguishes ways to explore the platform.\n\n03\nProduct explanation\n\nSupporting sections expand on the introductory proposition.\n\n04\nOriginal mockup\n\nThe archive’s laptop and tablet composition preserves the supplied presentation.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nTalent & recruitment\n\nBlack hero panels, lavender accents, and distinctive cloud-like section edges create a recognizable identity. Strong display type gives the product proposition priority over decorative detail, with lighter sections providing room for supporting information.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Nerdrabbit.\n\nExplore the original design compositions. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nNerdrabbit's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nNerdrabbit / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nParachute\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nCHILDCARE & DISCOVERY\nParachute\nEDUCATION INTERFACE\nGlocal Expert\nWORKPLACE OPERATIONS\nMercury Mailroom\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
